CHAPTER.VERS:
to one through the Ruach Hakodesh is given a dvar chochmah
a dvar of wisdom--Act 16:7 ; to another, according to the same Ruach Hakodesh, a dvar da'as
word of knowledge--Act 5:3 ;

to another, by the same Ruach Hakodesh, emunah
Mt 17:20-21 ; to another, by the one Ruach Hakodesh, matnot harippuy (gifts of healing
refuah)--Act 3:6-16 ;
